phrase: retry scanning longest character streak up to at most {cap}
phrase: find longest repeated character streak capped at most {cap}
test: text="aaabbccccd" cap=3
expect: => i=3 r=0.0 ok=true s="aaabbccccd" errors=0 n=0 res=[] cache=0 hits=0
test: text="xxxxxxxxx" cap=5
